The '''Dimensional Shift''' is a dimension in which two different [[Raid Bosses|Raid bosses]] can be found: the [[Cake Prince]] or the [[Dough King]].

==Spawning==
To spawn the Dimensional Shift, a player must first satisfy [[drip_mama]]'s conditions, which involves killing 500 enemies on [[Sea of Treats|Cake Land]]. After the conditions have been met, [[drip_mama]] will then say ''"We have defeated enough enemies. Do you want to open the portal now?"''.

There can be two outcomes:
* If the player chooses to say "Yes", an announcement will appear: <b><i>[[System Messages|{{Color|text="A dimension has spawned."|color=#FF0000|outline={{Outline}}}}]]</i></b>. Inside this dimension, the player can find the [[Cake Prince]].
* If the player chooses to say "Yes" while holding a [[Sweet Chalice]], an announcement will appear: <b><i>[[System Messages|{{Color|text="A dimension worthy of a god has spawned."|color=#FF0000|outline={{Outline}}}}]]</i></b>. The user with the [[Sweet Chalice]] must be the one to interact with [[drip_mama]]. Inside this version of the dimension, the player can find the [[Dough King]].

==Access==
To access the Dimensional Shift, assuming that it has spawned, a mirror behind the house where [[drip_mama]] stands will be activated. Upon entering this mirror, the player will be teleported to the dimension.

==Trivia==
* After the [[Cake Prince]]/[[Dough King]] has been defeated, all of the players inside the Dimensional Shift will be teleported back to the [[Sea of Treats]].
* The [[Cake Prince]]/[[Dough King]] will despawn after 7 minutes and 30 seconds.
* It is possible that the player gets Anti-Cheated if they go through the portal. When this happens, the player will be teleported to the portal, and they will have to go through the portal again.
* The [[Soundtracks|soundtrack]] for this location is ''Lizard Bandit Clan'', similar to [[Battle of the Gods]], [[Swan's Room]], and [[Liberation of Tiki Outpost]].
* There is a glitch where the player spawns in the sky and falls when they finish the raid. 
**There is another glitch where the player is transformed with [[Buddha#Moveset_(V2)|Awakened Buddha]]'s '''[Z] Shift''' ability and jump when they get teleported back to the [[Sea of Treats]]. Doing so will send them flying.

